<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lyondell upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lyondell upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential upgraded Lyondell Petrochemical Co to buy from hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Separately, Lyondell said Monday supply and demand factors for its petrochemicals business look strong for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Lyondell gained 3/8 to 24-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
